=== p2-windows · W7 · page:analytics/TrueCost (WinUI 3 / Fluent) ===
Parity unit : page:analytics/TrueCost   kind=page   web route=/analytics/tco
Web source  : web/src/features/analytics/pages/TrueCostPage.tsx
ADR refs    : ADR-002, ADR-004, ADR-005, ADR-006, ADR-011, ADR-013, ADR-014, ADR-015
Runner      : .NET 10.0.300 SDK present (dotnet --version 10.0.300) — NOT blocked.

=== APPROACH ===
- The repository's WinUI app is code-first C# (no .xaml page files); every feature surface lives under
  apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/<Name>/ as <Name>.Model.cs (pure, Microsoft.UI-free projection,
  unit-tested headlessly), <Name>.Source.cs (the cache-then-network data port, also Microsoft.UI-free),
  <Name>.ViewModel.cs (INotifyPropertyChanged + IDisposable state holder) and <Name>.cs (the Fluent view).
  The generated prompt's idealized "TrueCostPage.xaml + TrueCostPageViewModel.cs under TeslaSync/Features/
  Analytics" is mapped onto these real conventions; the surface registers itself with the W4
  ShellPageFactory by route name ("TrueCostOwnership"), which RouteTable.cs already maps to /tco and the
  /analytics/tco deep link.
- Data source (web useCostBreakdown · GET /analytics/tco?vehicle_id=…): ported as the Microsoft.UI-free
  ITrueCostBreakdownSource. The repository-backed TrueCostBreakdownSource resolves the scoped/primary
  vehicle via the shared IWidgetVehicleSource (native useSelectedVehicle + vehicles?.[0]?.id fallback) and
  runs one cache-then-network read of the generated operation get_api_v1_analytics_tco through the shared
  CacheThenNetworkEngine (cacheKey analytics:tco:{id}, shared with the dashboard CostBreakdownWidget), then
  parses each emission into the full SI TrueCostBreakdown (16 scalar fields + monthly rows) via
  TrueCostResultMapper. The parameterless TrueCostPage() defaults to EmptyTrueCostBreakdownSource (renders
  the empty state) — the established W7 default-feed pattern — while TrueCostPage(source, localizer) drives
  the full loading/empty/error/success matrix for DI hosts and the headless tests. No HTTP touches the view.
- Units: SI on the wire (total_wh, total_km, cost_per_km*). Display restatement happens only at projection
  time via the shared C# behavior port — UnitFormatters.FormatEnergy / FormatDistance + ScalarFormatters.
  FormatCurrency / FormatNumber (P1/S5). No non-SI is stored or computed.
- Catalog: 27 of the page's 32 i18n keys already existed verbatim in Strings/{en,ar,he}/Resources.resw
  (translation.tco.* + the two implicit common.unit.* the web ternary reads). FIVE keys were missing and
  were added, in sorted position, to all three locale catalogs (en/ar/he): translation.common.unit.gallon,
  translation.common.unit.liter, translation.tco.costPerKm.aria, translation.tco.cumulativeSavings.aria,
  translation.tco.monthlyEvVsGas.aria (English text seeded; resolves verbatim via ILocalizer/web key names).
- Vehicle scope: the native shell centralises the vehicle picker (VehiclePickerStatusBar / selectedVehicle),
  so the page does not pixel-clone the web header's per-page <VehicleSelect/>; it reads the scoped vehicle
  through the source's IWidgetVehicleSource and surfaces a TsDataFreshness chip (native DataFreshnessAuto).

